  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 158 - 64 × 6 ÷ 2 = 4 × 15 ÷ 3.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 15 and 158\n\nGiven: 158 - 64 × 6 ÷ 2 = 4 × 15 ÷ 3\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 15 - 64 × __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 4 × __**158 ÷ 3**__\n\n⇒ 15 - __**64 × **__**__3__** = __**4 × **__**__52.66__**\n\n⇒ __**15**____** - 19**__**__2__** = 210.64\n\n⇒ -177 ≠ 210.64\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 64 and 6\n\nGiven: 158 - 64 × 6 ÷ 2 = 4 × 15 ÷ 3\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 158 - 6 × __**64 ÷ 2**__ = 4 × __**15 ÷ 3**__\n\n⇒ 158 - __**6 × 32**__ = __**4 × 5**__\n\n⇒ __**158 - 192**__ = 20\n\n⇒ -34 ≠ 1\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 64 and 4\n\nGiven: 158 - 64 × 6 ÷ 2 = 4 × 15 ÷ 3\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 158 - 4 × __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 64 × __**15 ÷ 3**__\n\n⇒ 158 - __**4 × 3**__ = __**64 × 5**__\n\n⇒ __**158 - 12**__ = 320\n\n⇒ 146 ≠ 320\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) 6 and 4**\n\nGiven: 158 - 64 × 6 ÷ 2 = 4 × 15 ÷ 3\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 158 - 64 × __**4 ÷ 2**__ = 6 × __**15 ÷ 3**__\n\n⇒ 158 - **__64 × 2__** = __**6 × 5**__\n\n⇒ __**158 - 128**__ = 30\n\n⇒ **30 = 30**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
